# Optional: export browser cookies for YouTube/Facebook on VPS/datacenter IPs.
#
# Setup:
# 1. Install Firefox and log in to YouTube + Facebook
# 2. Use extension "Get cookies.txt LOCALLY" (export current site)
# 3. Save as cookies.txt
# 4. Local dev: place in backend/cookies.txt
# 5. Production (Coolify/Docker): mount at /app/cookies.txt
#    OR set env COOKIES_FILE=/app/cookies.txt
#
# Netscape HTTP Cookie File format is required.
#
# Optional YouTube PO token (advanced, if bot checks persist):
#   YOUTUBE_PO_TOKEN=android.gvs+YOUR_TOKEN
